sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Faculty as Faculty User
    participant CLI as CliController
    participant Auth as AuthService
    participant Svc as StudentService
    participant Repo as FileStudentRepository
    participant Engine as AnalyticsEngine
    participant IntSvc as InterventionService
    participant Strat as InterventionStrategy

    Note over Faculty, Auth: Phase 1: Authentication & Session Setup
    Faculty ->> CLI: Enter username ("faculty") and password ("admin123")
    CLI ->> Auth: login("faculty", "admin123")
    Auth ->> Auth: hashPassword("admin123") -> SHA-256
    Auth -->> CLI: FacultyUser instance (authenticated)

    Note over Faculty, Repo: Phase 2: Assessment Data Input & Storage
    Faculty ->> CLI: Select Option 5 (Update Marks: IT1=18.0, IT2=16.0, Att=58.0%)
    CLI ->> Svc: updateAcademicRecord("23BCE1015", newRecord)
    Svc ->> Repo: findByRegNumber("23BCE1015")
    Repo -->> Svc: Student instance
    Svc ->> Svc: student.setAcademicRecord(newRecord)
    Svc ->> Repo: save(student)
    Repo ->> Repo: flush() -> serialize to students_db.csv
    Repo -->> Svc: Saved Student

    Note over CLI, Engine: Phase 3: Risk Analytics & Causal Attribution
    CLI ->> Engine: assessStudentRisk(student)
    Engine ->> Engine: calculateCompositeScore() -> 39.5 / 100.0
    Engine ->> Engine: Evaluate Attendance Deficit (58.0% < 75.0%)
    Engine ->> Engine: Compute failureProbability (83.9%) via Sigmoid
    Engine ->> Engine: Determine RiskLevel.HIGH & Compile Risk Drivers
    Engine -->> CLI: RiskAssessment instance (HIGH, 83.9%)

    Note over CLI, Strat: Phase 4: Strategy-Driven Intervention Generation
    CLI ->> IntSvc: generateInterventionsForStudent(student)
    loop For each registered strategy (Remedial, Attendance, PeerTutoring)
        IntSvc ->> Strat: isApplicable(student)
        Strat -->> IntSvc: true (deficiency matches criteria)
        IntSvc ->> Strat: createIntervention(student, "INT-1008")
        Strat -->> IntSvc: Intervention instance
        IntSvc ->> Svc: student.addIntervention(intervention)
    end
    IntSvc -->> CLI: List<Intervention> (Remedial Coaching, Attendance Advisory)

    Note over CLI, Faculty: Phase 5: Displaying Formatted Results
    CLI -->> Faculty: Render ASCII Dossier, Risk Gauge & Assigned Action Plans
